# Student Attendance Management System

A complete Student Attendance Management System built with Python using Tkinter/CustomTkinter, SQLite, Matplotlib, Pandas, and OpenPyXL.

## Features

- Secure login with role-based access for Admin and Teacher
- Modern desktop UI using CustomTkinter
- Student registration, update, delete, and search
- Daily attendance marking for Present, Absent, Late, and Excused
- Dashboard summarizing attendance metrics
- Attendance reports by date, class, and student
- Excel and CSV export support
- SQLite database with transaction-safe updates
- Password hashing using PBKDF2-SHA256

