## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python main.py
```

## Default Login

- Username: admin
- Password: Admin@123

The first time you log in, the system will prompt you to change the default password.

## Database

The application automatically creates the SQLite database and required tables when it starts for the first time.

- Database file: `data/attendance_system.db`
- Tables: `users`, `classes`, `students`, `attendance`

## Usage Notes

- Admins can manage all student and attendance records.
- Teachers can mark attendance for their assigned classes.
- Reports can be exported to CSV or Excel files.
- The system prevents duplicate attendance entries for the same student on the same date.

## Troubleshooting

- If the app doesn't start, ensure all dependencies are installed:
  ```bash
  pip install -r requirements.txt
  ```
- If the database file is missing, delete the `data/attendance_system.db` file and restart the app; it will be recreated automatically.
- If the GUI appears blank, make sure your display environment supports Tkinter.

